    <div class="clearfix post-26600 page type-page status-publish hentry" id="26600">

        
        <section data-header-style="" class="row fw-row  dynamic-header-change">
            <div class="spb-row  " data-row-type="" data-wrap="full-width-contained" data-image-movement="fixed" data-content-stretch="false" data-row-height="content-height" data-col-v-pos="default" data-legacy="true" style="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;">

                
                
                
                <div class="spb_content_element clearfix" style="">
                     <section  class="row ">
	<div class="spb_content_element col-sm-12 spb_text_column">
		<div class="spb-asset-content" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;">
			
<h1>Bezoek Monk Eindhoven</h1>

		</div>
	</div> </section>
 <section  class="row ">
	<div class="spb-column-container col-sm-4   "   style=" ">
		<div class="spb-column-inner row clearfix" style="padding-left:0px; padding-right:0px;">
		 <section  class="row ">
	<div class="spb_content_element col-sm-12 spb_text_column">
		<div class="spb-asset-content" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<div class="title-wrap"><h3 class="spb-heading spb-icon-heading"><span><i class="fa-map-marker"></i>Hier zijn wij</span></h3></div>
			
<p style="text-align: left;"><strong>Monk bouldergym<br />
</strong>Berkenstraat 1A<br />
5616 LV Eindhoven</p>
<p><strong>Contact<br />
</strong>&gt; <a href="tel:0031402950488">bel 040 295 04 88</a><br />
&gt; <a href="&#x6d;&#x61;&#x69;&#x6c;&#x74;&#x6f;&#x3a;&#101;&#105;&#110;&#100;&#104;oven&#x40;&#x6d;&#x6f;&#x6e;&#x6b;&#x2e;&#x6e;&#x6c;">stuur een e-mail</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>

		</div>
	</div> </section>
 
		</div>
	</div>  
	<div class="spb_content_element col-sm-4 spb_text_column">
		<div class="spb-asset-content" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<div class="title-wrap"><h3 class="spb-heading spb-icon-heading"><span><i class="fa-location-arrow"></i>Zo kom je hier</span></h3></div>
			
<p><strong>Trein<br />
</strong>15 minuten <a href="https://www.google.nl/maps/dir/Strijp-S,+Eindhoven/Monk+bouldergym+Eindhoven,+Berkenstraat+1A,+5616+LV+Eindhoven/@51.4451007,5.4565068,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m14!4m13!1m5!1m1!1s0x47c6d96b6808621b:0x2b2d71fbbeb4ca51!2m2!1d5.4585012!2d51.4466557!1m5!1m1!1s0x47c6d9149b60f01d:0xff5af128fe5a81d8!2m2!1d5.4586381!2d51.4434773!3e2">lopen</a> vanaf <a href="https://www.google.nl/maps/dir//Strijp-S,+Eindhoven/@51.4467418,5.3884607,12z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m9!4m8!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x47c6d96b6808621b:0x2b2d71fbbeb4ca51!2m2!1d5.4585012!2d51.4466557!3e3">Strijp-S</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Bus</strong><br />
6 minuten <a href="https://www.google.nl/maps/dir/Eindhoven,+Glaspoort,+5617+BD+Eindhoven/Monk+bouldergym+Eindhoven,+Berkenstraat+1A,+5616+LV+Eindhoven/@51.4437571,5.459036,17z/data=!4m14!4m13!1m5!1m1!1s0x47c6d91378eadf07:0x3918e78edafa853e!2m2!1d5.462071!2d51.445266!1m5!1m1!1s0x47c6d9149b60f01d:0xff5af128fe5a81d8!2m2!1d5.4586381!2d51.4434773!3e2">lopen</a> vanaf <a href="https://www.google.nl/maps/dir//Eindhoven,+Glaspoort,+5617+BD+Eindhoven/@51.4465284,5.4592229,15.42z/data=!4m9!4m8!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x47c6d91378eadf07:0x3918e78edafa853e!2m2!1d5.462071!2d51.445266!3e3">bushalte Glaspoort</a>.</p>
<p><strong>Auto (parkeerplaats)<br />
</strong><a href="https://www.google.nl/maps/dir//Kastanjelaan,+5616+NJ+Eindhoven/@51.4444547,5.3891883,12z/data=!4m9!4m8!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x47c6d913341a8add:0x2f4c7364b9db9c1e!2m2!1d5.4592288!2d51.4443686!3e0">P4 Kastanjelaan,</a> parkeerterrein (betaald; betaalautomaat)<br />
<a href="https://www.google.nl/maps/dir//Kastanjelaan,+Eindhoven/@51.4443607,5.4573839,18.06z/data=!4m9!4m8!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x47c6d96cc0e5e611:0x8a60f52459c64e14!2m2!1d5.4573673!2d51.4445833!3e0">Kastanjelaan,</a> langs de weg (betaald; zone 5157)</p>

		</div>
	</div>  
	<div class="spb_content_element col-sm-4 spb_text_column">
		<div class="spb-asset-content" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;">
			<div class="title-wrap"><h3 class="spb-heading spb-icon-heading"><span><i class="fa-car"></i>Parkeer info</span></h3></div>
			
<p>Gelieve om wijkoverlast te beperken niet in de Berkenstraat en omliggende wijk te parkeren. Je kunt op loopafstand parkeren aan de <strong>Kastanjelaan</strong> (zone 5157), op parkeerterrein <strong>P4 Kastanjelaan</strong> op Strijp S of op de parking naast Monk. De eerste 15 minuten zijn gratis, dus in- en uitrijden blijft mogelijk.</p>

		</div>
	</div> </section>
                 </div>
                
                
            </div><!-- .spb-row -->

            </section>

